                                "sense_id": "93efe52f-2a47-36dd-b5ca-0dec46fc11bd",
                                "text": "Among the handsomest trees which I have met is the \"Timbo\" (Enterolobium timbosa), which grows sometimes to the height of [...]. Half a dozen other species of Enterolobium, all inferior to the Timbo, grow in the Paraguayan forests."
                            },
